    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "gym_koori_020_trainer_01",
      "hash64": "64B056279C27961C",
      "text": "Bienvenue ! Je vous attendais.\\c\\nIci, vous êtes en haut de la piste. Le point\\nde départ du parcours de glisse, en somme.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 30,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "gym_koori_020_trainer_02",
      "hash64": "64B059279C279B35",
      "text": "D’ici, vous vous lancerez sur votre Poké Monture\\npour glisser sur cette piste entourée de nature !",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "gym_koori_020_trainer_03",
      "hash64": "64B058279C279982",
      "text": "Pour réussir l’examen de l’Arène, vous devez\\natteindre la ligne arrivée avant la fin du chrono !",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "gym_koori_020_trainer_04",
      "hash64": "64B053279C279103",
      "text": "Alors, vous sentez-vous d’attaque pour\\ndescendre cette piste enneigée ?",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "gym_koori_020_trainer_05",
      "hash64": "64B052279C278F50",
      "text": "C’est parti alors !\\c\\nTout schuss ! Et profitez bien de ce beau\\npaysage enneigé pendant votre descente !",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "gym_koori_020_select_01",
      "hash64": "66DD846D70418449",
      "text": "Je suis prêt[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0100)]e à y aller !",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 12,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0100"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "gym_koori_020_select_02",
      "hash64": "66DD816D70417F30",
      "text": "Qu’est-ce qu’il faut faire, déjà ?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "gym_koori_020_select_03",
      "hash64": "66DD826D704180E3",
      "text": "Je ne suis pas encore prêt[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0100)]e...",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 26,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0100"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "gym_koori_020_trainer_06",
      "hash64": "64B055279C279469",
      "text": "Félicitations pour avoir franchi la ligne d’arrivée\\naussi vite ! C’était très impressionnant !\\c\\nJ’avais l’impression de revoir Grusha quand\\nil était au sommet de son art...",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 94,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "gym_koori_020_system_01",
      "hash64": "5BAE1046691347DE",
      "text": "Ah, évidemment, vous avez réussi votre examen\\nhaut la main ! Allez l’annoncer à la réception !",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "gym_koori_020_trainer_07",
      "hash64": "64B054279C2792B6",
      "text": "Je suis triste d’avoir à vous annoncer ça,\\nmais vous avez échoué à l’examen...\\c\\nAu moins, vous ne vous êtes pas blessé[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0100)]e,\\nc’est le plus important !",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 78,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 120,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0100"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "gym_koori_020_trainer_08",
      "hash64": "64B05F279C27A567",
      "text": "Mais pas d’inquiétude. Vous pouvez passer un\\nexamen d’Arène autant de fois que nécessaire.\\c\\nAlors, ne renoncez pas et réessayez quand\\nvous voulez !",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 90,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
